CORE
overlapping_port_driver.sv
--top top --bound 1
^\[top\.p_parent\] .*: REFUTED$
^\[top\.p_child\] .*: REFUTED$
^\[top\.c_agree\] .*: PROVED$
^\[top\.c_disagree\] .*: PROVED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Two actual drivers of the same wire bit resolve conflicts. Both
combinations of driver inputs are legal.
